WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:30.625
In this verse,

2
00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:32.750
After describing the temporary

3
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.750
and sorrowful nature of the material world,

4
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.000
Lord Krishna now speaks of the eternal,

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.375
indestructible nature

6
00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:40.958
of the spiritual world.

7
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:43.000
In this verse, He makes it clear

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.083
that His supreme abode

9
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:49.208
can only be attained
 through exclusive devotion.

10
00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:50.833
In the chapters ahead,

11
00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:53.000
He will shed further light

12
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.000
on the various aspects of this devotion.

13
00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:02.291
Lord Krishna reveals

14
00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:05.166
that the Supreme Lord – He Himself –

15
00:01:05.166 --> 00:01:08.541
can only be attained through ananya bhakti,

16
00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:12.833
meaning exclusive, undivided devotion.

17
00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:16.208
Here, Lord Krishna confirms

18
00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:20.000
what He said in verse 8.14 –

19
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.666
that only continuous, 
unwavering remembrance of Him leads

20
00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:27.625
to the supreme destination.

21
00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:30.416
Notice how He returns

22
00:01:30.416 --> 00:01:34.166
to this point again and again.

23
00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:37.708
He clearly states that no 
combination of yoga, knowledge,

24
00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:44.083
or rituals alone can take one there.

25
00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:45.875
Only pure devotion

26
00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:48.916
is the path to the supreme abode –

27
00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:53.791
which is eternal and unchanging.

28
00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:58.458
Lord Krishna then describes His divine nature:

29
00:01:58.458 --> 00:01:59.875
‘yastyānteḥ-sthāni

30
00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:05.250
bhūtāni yena sarvam idaṃ tatam’ – meaning,

31
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.333
although all beings exist within Him,

32
00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:12.416
He also pervades all of existence.

33
00:02:12.416 --> 00:02:15.125
This reveals the inconceivable nature

34
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:17.000
of Lord Krishna –

35
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.916
He is present within everything as Paramātmā,

36
00:02:19.916 --> 00:02:24.583
and yet, in His supreme abode,
 He is beyond everything as well.

37
00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:28.083
Let us now see how we can bring

38
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:30.916
this eternal wisdom into our own lives.

39
00:02:35.666 --> 00:02:39.000
Have you ever wondered

40
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.875
why some of life’s deepest mysteries

41
00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:45.958
lie beyond the reach of the mind?

42
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:50.041
There are many things in life

43
00:02:50.041 --> 00:02:52.791
that the intellect alone

44
00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:56.541
cannot grasp.

45
00:02:56.541 --> 00:02:58.625
You may try to understand

46
00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:02.041
every detail through logic,

47
00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:06.791
but sometimes reason and analysis

48
00:03:06.791 --> 00:03:09.833
are not enough.

49
00:03:09.833 --> 00:03:11.333
This is where

50
00:03:11.333 --> 00:03:14.166
the heart steps in.

51
00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:18.000
The intellect has its own purpose –

52
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.708
it helps you navigate the world,

53
00:03:21.708 --> 00:03:23.041
make decisions,

54
00:03:23.041 --> 00:03:27.083
and solve problems.

55
00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:29.875
But it has

56
00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:32.666
its limits too.

57
00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:36.500
When you encounter emotions, relationships,

58
00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:40.000
or spiritual experiences,

59
00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:44.541
trying to understand them through logic alone

60
00:03:44.541 --> 00:03:47.791
often leaves you restless

61
00:03:47.791 --> 00:03:53.500
or feeling disconnected.

62
00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.333
In such moments,

63
00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:59.708
trust your heart.

64
00:03:59.708 --> 00:04:02.000
When the mind fails

65
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.041
to make sense of something,

66
00:04:05.041 --> 00:04:07.791
turn toward the heart.

67
00:04:07.791 --> 00:04:10.708
The heart’s faith, devotion,

68
00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:14.916
and deep intuition

69
00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:16.791
can understand things

70
00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:20.291
in ways

71
00:04:20.291 --> 00:04:24.208
the intellect never can.

72
00:04:24.208 --> 00:04:28.416
Even an unlettered person, living close to nature,

73
00:04:28.416 --> 00:04:32.041
learns truths about life

74
00:04:32.041 --> 00:04:34.833
that no book

75
00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:38.000
can teach.

76
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.416
Surrender, not logic,

77
00:04:41.416 --> 00:04:44.666
can open those doors for you too.

78
00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:48.000
When even the greatest challenges come,

79
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:52.250
and logic offers no solution –

80
00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:57.583
lean on faith, trust from the heart,

81
00:04:57.583 --> 00:05:01.083
meditate deeply on the Lord,

82
00:05:01.083 --> 00:05:05.583
and offer all your efforts to Him. Often,

83
00:05:05.583 --> 00:05:10.791
the answer arrives in the mind quite suddenly.

84
00:05:10.791 --> 00:05:13.125
When you find the balance

85
00:05:13.125 --> 00:05:16.666
between the intellect and
 the heart, you experience

86
00:05:16.666 --> 00:05:20.083
the fullness of life

87
00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:23.375
and connect with those deeper truths

88
00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:27.500
that are beyond reason.

89
00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:30.208
This is the path of ananya bhakti
 – exclusive devotion –

90
00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:35.000
that leads you toward lasting peace.

91
00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:43.750
Love and understanding –

92
00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.958
these are the two foundations

93
00:05:45.958 --> 00:05:52.041
of any relationship.

94
00:05:52.041 --> 00:05:56.541
In family life, there will be times

95
00:05:56.541 --> 00:05:59.291
when relationships become difficult

96
00:05:59.291 --> 00:06:02.916
and differences arise.

97
00:06:02.916 --> 00:06:04.541
In such moments,

98
00:06:04.541 --> 00:06:06.500
it is natural to analyse the situation –

99
00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.500
trying to figure out

100
00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:12.875
who is right and who is wrong.

101
00:06:12.875 --> 00:06:16.500
But I invite you to go beyond that.

102
00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.583
When things get difficult,

103
00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:22.416
open your heart

104
00:06:22.416 --> 00:06:24.750
and try to see the situation

105
00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:29.166
through love, not logic.

106
00:06:29.166 --> 00:06:32.458
Just as nature provides

107
00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:34.833
air, light, and water

108
00:06:34.833 --> 00:06:36.500
to all without discrimination,

109
00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.791
your love for your family

110
00:06:40.791 --> 00:06:44.083
should be equal

111
00:06:44.083 --> 00:06:46.583
and selfless.

112
00:06:46.583 --> 00:06:50.666
In a family, it is not necessary

113
00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:51.875
to always

114
00:06:51.875 --> 00:06:54.958
prove yourself right.

115
00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:57.625
What matters more is staying connected

116
00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:00.416
to each other through understanding,

117
00:07:00.416 --> 00:07:03.000
compassion, and warmth.

118
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:07.083
Logic may prove you right,

119
00:07:07.083 --> 00:07:10.416
but it is emotional understanding

120
00:07:10.416 --> 00:07:13.166
that truly brings people together.

121
00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:19.041
When you let go of the need
 to prove your point of view

122
00:07:19.041 --> 00:07:22.041
and instead choose to

123
00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:24.833
see the situation through love,

124
00:07:24.833 --> 00:07:31.583
you deepen relationships through empathy.

125
00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:35.208
Let go of the desire to label each other

126
00:07:35.208 --> 00:07:38.625
as right or wrong.

127
00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:42.083
Abandon arguments and embrace

128
00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:45.666
love to bring sweetness into relationships.

129
00:07:45.666 --> 00:07:49.958
When you choose love over ego,

130
00:07:49.958 --> 00:07:53.916
you strengthen family bonds

131
00:07:53.916 --> 00:07:58.250
and find peace amid challenges.

132
00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:07.333
Work done not just with the mind,

133
00:08:07.333 --> 00:08:13.375
but with the heart – 
that is the work that gives life meaning.

134
00:08:13.375 --> 00:08:16.291
In your professional life,

135
00:08:16.291 --> 00:08:18.916
your attitude toward your work

136
00:08:18.916 --> 00:08:22.500
changes everything.

137
00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:26.875
Just as bhakti, or pure devotion,

138
00:08:26.875 --> 00:08:29.500
is about having the right attitude toward Me,

139
00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:32.916
your attitude at the workplace too

140
00:08:32.916 --> 00:08:36.833
should be filled with dedication, 

141
00:08:36.833 --> 00:08:39.416
humility, and focus.

142
00:08:39.416 --> 00:08:41.666
When you engage in your work

143
00:08:41.666 --> 00:08:43.625
with a sense of purpose and devotion,

144
00:08:43.625 --> 00:08:45.833
it transforms

145
00:08:45.833 --> 00:08:48.500
the way you work,

146
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.416
the way you interact with others,

147
00:08:51.416 --> 00:08:55.500
and the way you carry yourself.

148
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.250
It is not just about

149
00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.791
getting things done –

150
00:09:00.791 --> 00:09:03.666
it is about putting your heart

151
00:09:03.666 --> 00:09:06.666
into what you do.

152
00:09:06.666 --> 00:09:09.416
If you see your work

153
00:09:09.416 --> 00:09:12.416
as merely a means to an end,

154
00:09:12.416 --> 00:09:15.750
you may find yourself caught

155
00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.833
in frustration and stress.

156
00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:22.500
But when you see your work

157
00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.625
as an opportunity

158
00:09:23.625 --> 00:09:27.291
to grow and contribute –

159
00:09:27.291 --> 00:09:29.750
just like devotion –

160
00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:33.833
you create a positive environment

161
00:09:33.833 --> 00:09:37.791
that leads to success and fulfilment.

162
00:09:37.791 --> 00:09:41.458
Take the example of a dedicated teacher

163
00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:44.083
who does not limit his work

164
00:09:44.083 --> 00:09:48.583
to just delivering lessons.

165
00:09:48.583 --> 00:09:52.708
He is devoted to each student,

166
00:09:52.708 --> 00:09:56.416
recognises their individual strengths,

167
00:09:56.416 --> 00:09:58.791
and makes extra effort

168
00:09:58.791 --> 00:10:01.416
to nurture them.

169
00:10:01.416 --> 00:10:04.583
He sees each lesson not just as information,

170
00:10:04.583 --> 00:10:06.541
but as an opportunity

171
00:10:06.541 --> 00:10:09.416
to pass on knowledge and values.

172
00:10:09.416 --> 00:10:12.666
Through this devoted approach,

173
00:10:12.666 --> 00:10:13.916
he not only

174
00:10:13.916 --> 00:10:17.333
transforms his students’ lives,

175
00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:20.916
but also experiences deep satisfaction

176
00:10:20.916 --> 00:10:23.708
and joy himself.

177
00:10:23.708 --> 00:10:27.833
His work becomes not just a job,

178
00:10:27.833 --> 00:10:31.291
but his life’s purpose –

179
00:10:31.291 --> 00:10:33.500
just as

180
00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.833
devotion becomes purpose

181
00:10:35.833 --> 00:10:39.958
for a true seeker.

182
00:10:39.958 --> 00:10:42.083
With the right attitude,

183
00:10:42.083 --> 00:10:45.625
your workplace can become

184
00:10:45.625 --> 00:10:48.833
a temple of spiritual practice,

185
00:10:48.833 --> 00:10:51.250
where every task becomes

186
00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:55.375
an expression of devotion

187
00:10:55.375 --> 00:10:57.916
to the divine.
